"\"use strict\";Object.defineProperty(exports,\"__esModule\",{value:true});Object.defineProperty(exports,\"default\",{enumerable:true,get:function(){return MDXContent}});function _extends(){_extends=Object.assign||function(target){for(var i=1;i<arguments.length;i++){var source=arguments[i];for(var key in source){if(Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(source,key)){target[key]=source[key]}}}return target};return _extends.apply(this,arguments)}function _createMdxContent(props){var _components=_extends({a:\"a\",blockquote:\"blockquote\",em:\"em\",h2:\"h2\",p:\"p\"},props.components);return Vue.h(Vue.Fragment,null,Vue.h(_components.h2,null,\"Introduction\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Yayoi was born into a conservative Muslim family in Qinghai, China, yet within her was a vast world of her own.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"In her early years, she developed a deep interest in \",Vue.h(_components.em,null,\"World of Tanks Blitz\"),\", and even wrote several highly informative columns on German tanks, self-propelled artillery, and related topics. Her writing was remarkably professional, and her perspectives often refreshingly distinctive. As a rhythm-game enthusiast, she was also captivated by the rhythms and melodies of \",Vue.h(_components.em,null,\"Muse Dash\"),\", and could often be found at shopping malls with friends, tapping and sliding away in front of the dryer-like arcade cabinets of \",Vue.h(_components.em,null,\"maimai\"),\".\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.h2,null,\"Foreign Land\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"In 2024, amid shifting social and political pressures surrounding religious identity in China, Yayoi left Qinghai with her family and moved to Malaysia, where she began living abroad as an international student.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"As her father worked overseas to support the family, she lived with her mother and two younger brothers. Her mother’s supervision and control over her, however, became almost pathological. Whenever she went out, her phone would be bombarded with countless messages from her mother demanding that she come home. On top of this, her family cut off her financial support because she was a trans girl, causing her relationship with them to deteriorate further and further.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"“About Her relationship with her family… I’m afraid they wouldn’t even know if she were gonna rot at home.”\"),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Her financial support was not the only thing to collapse. Her legal status as an international student and her hopes of continuing her education also began to slip away. One night in early 2025, under the unbearable weight of her circumstances, Yayoi made the most heartbreaking of decisions, ending her life at home in Malaysia.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"After learning what had happened, her friend Dangshuang did everything she could. Through Yayoi’s partner, she managed to find out which residential complex Yayoi was staying in, then immediately called the 999 emergency hotline and rushed to the scene as quickly as she could. Yet, by the time the rescuers arrived, there was nothing more that could be done. Her young life came to an end on that winter night.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.h2,null,\"The Other Shore\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"The road stretches on, while dreams return to a distant land.\",Vue.h(\"sup\",null,Vue.h(\"a\",{href:\"#footnote-1\",id:\"footnote-ref-1\"},\"1\")),\" Qinghai was where her journey began, but it was never where she belonged. Life in Malaysia was oppressive and heavy, and she could hardly say, “Home is where the heart is.” Yet there, she found not only the air in which she could exist as her true self, but also the person she loved most dearly.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"The fragrance fills my bosom and sleeves,\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Yet the way is long for sending it to thee.\",Vue.h(\"sup\",null,Vue.h(\"a\",{href:\"#footnote-2\",id:\"footnote-ref-2\"},\"2\"))),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Between this shore and the other lies perhaps the greatest distance in this world. The hope of being together, and the love that was never able to reach its destination, ultimately remained with her in the sea breeze of that foreign land.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Contributors for this entry: One Among Us, \",Vue.h(_components.a,{href:\"https://twitter.com/dangshuang\"},\"Dangshuang\")),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Tweets Summary: \",Vue.h(_components.a,{href:\"https://space.bilibili.com/1362658251\"},\"Uploaders’ Memorial Hall - Unofficial\")),\"\\n\",Vue.h(\"ol\",null,Vue.h(\"li\",{id:\"footnote-1\"},\"Yayoi once used this line as the bio on her Twitter/X profile.\",Vue.h(\"a\",{href:\"#footnote-ref-1\"},Vue.h(\"svg\",{viewBox:\"0 0 16 16\",version:\"1.1\",id:\"svg1\",\"xmlns:xlink\":\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\",xmlns:\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"xmlns:svg\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",style:\"margin-left: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: -2px; width: 1rem; height: 1rem\"},Vue.h(\"defs\",{id:\"defs1\"},Vue.h(\"linearGradient\",{id:\"linearGradient3\"},Vue.h(\"stop\",{style:\"stop-color:#ff8373;stop-opacity:1;\",offset:\"0.5\",id:\"stop3\"}),Vue.h(\"stop\",{style:\"stop-color:#ff8373;stop-opacity:0;\",offset:\"0.5\",id:\"stop4\"})),Vue.h(\"linearGradient\",{id:\"linearGradient1\"},Vue.h(\"stop\",{style:\"stop-color:#ff8373;stop-opacity:0;\",offset:\"0.5\",id:\"stop1\"}),Vue.h(\"stop\",{style:\"stop-color:#ff8373;stop-opacity:1;\",offset:\"0.5\",id:\"stop2\"})),Vue.h(\"linearGradient\",{\"xlink:href\":\"#linearGradient1\",id:\"linearGradient2\",x1:\"2.6681123\",y1:\"8\",x2:\"13.331888\",y2:\"8\",gradientUnits:\"userSpaceOnUse\",gradientTransform:\"translate(2.6678295,-2)\"}),Vue.h(\"linearGradient\",{\"xlink:href\":\"#linearGradient3\",id:\"linearGradient4\",x1:\"3.707522